= CEC Elections Impending

Because of Sun Yat-sen's death, an election has begun to choose the new Chairman of the Central Executive Commitee.

Who do you support?

- @left: Liao Zhongkai.
- @centerleft: Wang Jingwei.
- @right: Hu Hanmin
- @center: Tan Yankai.

@left
on-arrival: left_strength += 10;

We have given our support to Liao Zhongkai of the Communists.

@centerleft
on-arrival: center_left_strength += 10;

We have given our support to Wang Jingwei of the Leftists.

@right
on-arrival: right_strength += 10;

We have given our support to Hu Hanmin of the Rightists.

@center
on-arrival: left_strength -= 5; center_left_strength -= 5; right_strength -= 5;

We have given our support to Tan Yankai, a relatively centrist member.
